# StitchLabOS WiFi manager (Moonraker component wifi_manager, runs as pi).
# nmcli changes connections and the access point; the iw line is the one
# scan that works while wlan0 runs the AP; the two systemctl lines hold AP
# mode chosen in Mainsail against AccessPopup's timer. Keep the iw and
# systemctl lines identical to IW_AP_SCAN, TIMER_STOP and TIMER_START in
# stitchlabos-config/moonraker/components/wifi_manager.py.
pi ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/nmcli, /usr/sbin/iw dev wlan0 scan ap-force, /usr/bin/systemctl stop AccessPopup.timer, /usr/bin/systemctl start AccessPopup.timer
